{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/1_bulletin_eng.png?t=1742540286\" />Ever dreamed of running your own tea tavern? In your cozy teavern, you can create delightful treats - from melon bun sandwiches to fragrant milk tea with spices. Experiment with recipes and surprise your guests with unique flavors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/ezgif-4969e601d23f02.gif?t=1742540286\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/2_bulletin_eng.png?t=1742540286\" />Make your teavern truly yours! Choose decorations, arrange furniture, and design a space that reflects your style. The cozier your cafe, the more rewards you\u2019ll unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/ezgif-481e077d5c1052.gif?t=1742540286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/3_bulletin_eng.png?t=1742540286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Fiora, a mushroom girl running a tea tavern in a whimsical world made of sweets. Greet visitors, take your time, and embrace a slow-paced, stress-free experience - unless you decide to challenge yourself by choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/ezgif-4c830b88582f9c.gif?t=1742540286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/4_bulletin_eng.png?t=1742540286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every guest has a story to share. Listen to their tales over a cup of tea, learn more about their lives, and collect special keepsakes from your favorite customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/Characters_ENG.png?t=1742540286\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/5_bulletin_eng.png?t=1742540286\" />Play through the story mode to get to know your visitors and grow your tavern, or enjoy endless orders at your own pace in free play mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc96Are you ready to open the doors to your cozy teavern? \ud83c\udf70\u2615\ufe0f</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530860?t=1742540286","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530860?t=1742540286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/1e476e8103a149809e96ab9636afe4f28e7e83d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742540286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/1e476e8103a149809e96ab9636afe4f28e7e83d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742540286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530860/extras/1_bulletin_eng.png?t=1742540286\" />Ever dreamed of running your own tea tavern? In your cozy teavern, you can create delightful treats - from melon bun sandwiches to fragrant milk tea with spices. Experim